### Create a session
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Demo session" }

> {% client.global.set("sessionId", response.body.id); %}

### Send a message
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Say hello in exactly three words." }

### Send a follow-up that depends on the history
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "How many words were in your previous answer?" }

### Read the full history and accumulated cost
GET http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}
